## Recent Fixes (October 9, 2025)

### BUG-127: PMD No JSON Output (FIXED ✅)
- **Problem:** PMD returned 0 issues due to incompatible ruleset patterns with PMD 6.55.0
- **Impact:** Missing 7,299+ code quality issues
- **Fix:** Simplified ruleset to use category references only (removed exclude/re-include patterns)
- **Result:** Now detecting 7,299 PMD issues correctly

### COST OPTIMIZATION: Issue Grouping Strategy (COMPLETE ✅)
- **Problem:** $28.42 per analysis (9,451 individual AI calls)
- **Impact:** Unsustainable cost, reports too large (5+ MB)
- **Fix:** Group issues by rule/tool/severity, analyze only 1 per group
- **Result:** 99.8% cost reduction ($0.05 per analysis, 17 AI calls)

### FEATURE: Grouped Report Format + IDE Integration (COMPLETE ✅)
- **Problem:** 5+ MB reports impossible to review, no IDE integration
- **Impact:** Poor user experience, no automation possible
- **Fix:** Compact report (22 KB) + JSON attachments + IDE fix files
- **Result:** 227x smaller reports, 3,807 auto-fixable issues via IDE

### RUNAWAY COST INCIDENT: SimpleOpenRouter Client (FIXED ✅)
- **Problem:** ResilientAIClient made 21 API calls per issue (retries + key testing)
- **Impact:** $10+ charges, 4-5 hour hangs
- **Fix:** Created SimpleOpenRouterClient (1 call per issue, fallback on 401 only)
- **Result:** Exactly 1 API call per issue, no runaway costs

### HANG FIX: Universal Agents Initialization (FIXED ✅)
- **Problem:** V9ReportFormatterFinal tried to initialize Educator with language/size
- **Impact:** False Researcher Agent triggers, infinite hangs
- **Fix:** Removed initialization (Educator/Orchestrator/Researcher are universal)
- **Result:** No false triggers, report generation completes in <1s

